  "description": "SPLIT with TPO Application (2026/1080) T1 Purple Leaf Plum (x1) Reduce height by 3m down to previous points of reduction. Reason: To maintain the tree at a smaller size. Prevent overhang over driveway and neighbouring property. T16 Rowan (x1) Reduce branch overhanging the drive by 1.5m.Reason: Over hanging the drive way. T16 Mimosa (x1) Reduce crown by 1.5m all around. Reasin: To maintain the tree at a smaller size. Prevent overhang over driveway and neighbouring property. T3 Hawthorn (x1) Reduce lateral branches to give 1.5m clearance. Reason: To give clearence from the flats next door. G22 Holm Oaks (x2) Reduce heights by 3m. Reason: To maintain the trees at a smaller size in contet to the garden size. T21 Yew (x1) Reduce crown by 1-1.5m and raise lower front canopy.. Reason: To allow more light from the street light onto the drive way. T23 Yew (x1) Reduce height and width by 2.5m. Reduce protruding branch over the road by 3m. Reason: To maintain the tree at a smaller size. To prevent overhang over the road. T26 Yew (x1) Reduce the front bulging section and also the rear bulging section by 1.5-2m.Reason: To maintain the tree at a smaller size in cobtext to garden size. T6 Yew (x1) Reduce the rear of the tree by 2m (back to boundary). Reason: To prevent overhang over the neighbouring property. T7 Silver Birch (x1) Reduce height by 2.5m and width by 2m. Reduce branches over the lawn by 2-2.5m. Reason: To maintain the tree at a smaller size in context to garden size. T27 Hawthorn & Plum (x2) Cut back branches overhanging by 2.5m. Reason: Over hanging neihbouring property. T10 Crab Apple (x1) Reduce crown by 1-1.5m back to previous points.Reason: To maintain the tree at a smaller size in context to garden size. T11 Magnolia Grandiflora (x1) Reduce side over the lawn by 1-1.5m.Reason: Clearance over the lawn. T12 Pear (x1) Reduce the width of the southern side of the tree by 1-2m. Reason: To maintain the tree at a smaller size in context to garden size. T14 Apple (x1) ",
